{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/9c006ed772f5e012ba61c7d22fcba6a7.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three survivors. A corrupted world. Fragments that promise salvation but demand a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Emptiness Sire</strong>, you traverse a post-apocalyptic world consumed by <strong>cosmic horror</strong>, solving <strong>turn-based puzzles</strong> that test not only your logic but also your will to survive. The Knight, the Explorer, and the Guardian face ruins, devastated villages, and cities of cultists\u2014where every choice brings dilemmas and challenges what they are willing to sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/b1ca9264a08ed855d2970dc28391bf41.poster.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/b1ca9264a08ed855d2970dc28391bf41.webm?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/b1ca9264a08ed855d2970dc28391bf41.mp4?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>over 160 unique puzzles</strong>, you\u2019ll have to think, experiment, and use the power of <strong>undo</strong> to retrace your steps and escape death\u2026 but not every fate can be undone. Each <strong>puzzle</strong> unveils new challenges and deepens the mystery that spreads across four worlds: from the Knight\u2019s village to cultist cities, acid deserts, buried ruins, and a forbidden oasis that defies perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, fragments of the story intertwine between the characters and the world itself, revealing distorted truths and choices that will challenge you. What begins as a simple struggle for survival turns into a journey about control, regret, and the cost of undoing the inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/1f70f6a96f2f148a50bbd0a88efd048b.poster.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/1f70f6a96f2f148a50bbd0a88efd048b.webm?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/1f70f6a96f2f148a50bbd0a88efd048b.mp4?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, you\u2019ll feel the tension of the unknown and the growing corruption consuming everything around you. But one question remains: how far will you go to survive\u2014and what will be left of you when salvation and damnation become one and the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.poster.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.webm?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.mp4?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>160+ turn-based puzzles</strong> that challenge both logic and survival.<br><strong>Undo:</strong> retrace your steps without restarting the level.<br>Three playable and complementary protagonists, each with their own motives and dilemmas.<br><strong>Four unique worlds</strong>: villages, cultists, deserts, and impossible ruins.<br><strong>Cosmic horror</strong>: a corrupted world filled with mysteries and dangerous fragments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197200?t=1772198101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197200?t=1772198101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/7e0eace79fd6c4bb267c054928ee3d2a000226c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772198101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/7e0eace79fd6c4bb267c054928ee3d2a000226c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772198101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4129880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/9c006ed772f5e012ba61c7d22fcba6a7.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three survivors. A corrupted world. Fragments that promise salvation but demand a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Emptiness Sire</strong>, you traverse a post-apocalyptic world consumed by <strong>cosmic horror</strong>, solving <strong>turn-based puzzles</strong> that test not only your logic but also your will to survive. The Knight, the Explorer, and the Guardian face ruins, devastated villages, and cities of cultists\u2014where every choice brings dilemmas and