tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/1f70f6a96f2f148a50bbd0a88efd048b.mp4?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every step, you\u2019ll feel the tension of the unknown and the growing corruption consuming everything around you. But one question remains: how far will you go to survive\u2014and what will be left of you when salvation and damnation become one and the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.poster.avif?t=1772198101\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.webm?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/extras/5feb186898ab38199cdc2b87d0091eb1.mp4?t=1772198101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>160+ turn-based puzzles</strong> that challenge both logic and survival.<br><strong>Undo:</strong> retrace your steps without restarting the level.<br>Three playable and complementary protagonists, each with their own motives and dilemmas.<br><strong>Four unique worlds</strong>: villages, cultists, deserts, and impossible ruins.<br><strong>Cosmic horror</strong>: a corrupted world filled with mysteries and dangerous fragments.</p>","developers":["Oaks Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197200/header.jpg?t=1772198101","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS